ex:200;top:54.8%; left:16.7%;height:0;width:0;margin:0;padding:0;\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;top:-4px;left:-4px;width:8px;text-align:center;line-height:0;z-index:201\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%;line-height:110%;position:relative;top:-1.5em; left:-6.5em;width:6em;text-align:right;z-index:202;\"><div style=\"padding:1px;background:none\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:5px;left:-2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96rgryte_IS\" title=\"Örgryte IS\">Örgryte</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;z-index:200;top:69.1%; left:46.2%;height:0;width:0;margin:0;padding:0;\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;top:-4px;left:-4px;width:8px;text-align:center;line-height:0;z-index:201\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%;line-height:110%;position:relative;top:-1.5em; left:-6.5em;width:6em;text-align:right;z-index:202;\"><div style=\"padding:1px;background:none\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:5px;left:2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96sters_IF\" title=\"Östers IF\">Öster</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%\">Geografisk placering av de deltagande lagen i Superettan 2017.</div>\n</div>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Lag_och_arenor\">Lag och arenor</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Superettan_2017&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Redigera avsnitt: Lag och arenor\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>redigera</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Superettan_2017&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Redigera avsnitts källkod: Lag och arenor\"><span>redigera wikitext</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>16 lag kvalificerade sig för spel i superettan 2017 efter resultat från <a href=\"/wiki/Fotbollsallsvenskan_2016\" title=\"Fotbollsallsvenskan 2016\">Allsvenskan 2016</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Superettan_2016\" title=\"Superettan 2016\">Superettan 2016</a> och <a href=\"/wiki/Division_1_i_fotboll_f%C3%B6r_herrar_2016\" title=\"Division 1 i fotboll för herrar 2016\">Division 1 2016</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th width=\"130\">Lag\n</th>\n<th width=\"140\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sveriges_l%C3%A4n\" title=\"Sveriges län\">Län</a>\n</th>\n<th width=\"100\">Ort\n</th>\n<th>Arena\n</th>\n<th>Underlag\n</th>\n<th colspan=\"2\">Kapacitet\n</th>\n<th>Placering<br />2016\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Dalkurd_FF\" title=\"Dalkurd FF\">Dalkurd FF</a>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dalarnas_l%C3%A4n\" title=\"Dalarnas län\"><img alt=\"Dalarnas län\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fb/Dalarnas_vapen.svg/20px-Dalarnas_vapen.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"16\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fb/Dalarnas_vapen.svg/40px-Dalarnas_vapen.svg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"248\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/Dalarnas_l%C3%A4n\" title=\"Dalarnas län\">Dalarna</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Borl%C3%A4nge\" title=\"Borlänge\">Borlänge</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Domnarvsvallen\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Domnarvsvallen\">Domnarvsvallen</a>\n</td>\n<td>Konstgräs\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"display:none\">&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;06500.&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;0</span>6&#160;500\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"display:none\" class=\"sortkey\">d &#xfeff;</span><span class=\"sorttext\">4</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Degerfors_IF\" title=\"Degerfors IF\">Degerfors IF</a>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96rebro_l%C3%A4n\" title=\"Örebro län\"><img alt=\"Örebro län\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/31/%C3%96rebro_l%C3%A4n_vapen.svg/20px-%C3%96rebro_l%C3%A4n_vapen.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"16\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/31/%C3%96rebro_l%C3%A4n_vapen.svg/40px-%C3%96rebro_l%C3%A4n_vapen.svg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"251\" data-file-height=\"304\" /></a></span>&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96rebro_l%C3%A4n\" title=\"Örebro län\">Örebro</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Degerfors\" title=\"Degerfors\">Degerfors</