yttningskval\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>redigera</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Superettan_2017&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Redigera avsnitts källkod: Uppflyttningskval\"><span>redigera wikitext</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<dl><dd><div class=\"noprint hatnote\"><i>Fördjupning: <a href=\"/wiki/Kvalspelet_till_Fotbollsallsvenskan_2018\" title=\"Kvalspelet till Fotbollsallsvenskan 2018\">Kvalspelet till Fotbollsallsvenskan 2018</a></i></div></dd></dl>\n<p>Laget som slutade på 3:e plats, <a href=\"/wiki/Trelleborgs_FF\" title=\"Trelleborgs FF\">Trelleborgs FF</a>, spelade ett kvalspel mot det lag som slutade på 14:e plats i <a href=\"/wiki/Fotbollsallsvenskan_2017\" title=\"Fotbollsallsvenskan 2017\">fotbollsallsvenskan 2017</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/J%C3%B6nk%C3%B6pings_S%C3%B6dra_IF\" title=\"Jönköpings Södra IF\">Jönköpings Södra</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-22\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-22\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>22<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0px\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-bottom:4px; width:100%; border-style:none; background-color:;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:3%; font-weight:bold; font-size:0.875em;\" id=\"1\">1</td>\n<td style=\"width:12%; text-align:right; font-weight:normal; font-size:0.9375em;\">15 november 2017</td>\n<td style=\"width:24%; text-align:right; font-weight:bold; font-size:1em;;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Trelleborgs_FF\" title=\"Trelleborgs FF\">Trelleborgs FF</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:12%; text-align:center; font-weight:bold; font-size:1em;\">\n<a href=\"/wiki/Kvalspelet_till_Fotbollsallsvenskan_2018#Första_mötet\" title=\"Kvalspelet till Fotbollsallsvenskan 2018\">2 – 0</a></td>\n\n<td style=\"width:24%; text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:1em;;\"><a href=\"/wiki/J%C3%B6nk%C3%B6pings_S%C3%B6dra_IF\" title=\"Jönköpings Södra IF\">Jönköpings Södra</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:24%; text-align:left; font-size:0.875em;\"><a href=\"/wiki/V%C3%A5ngavallen\" title=\"Vångavallen\">Vångavallen</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Trelleborg\" title=\"Trelleborg\">Trelleborg</a></td>\n<th style=\"width:1%; font-size:0.9375em;\"></th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:right; font-size:0.9375em;\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\"></td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:right; font-size:0.875em;\"></td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:center; font-size:0.875em;\"></td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:left; font-size:0.875em;\"></td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:left; font-size:0.875em;\" rowspan=\"3\" colspan=\"2\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:center; font-size:0.90em;\" colspan=\"3\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:right; font-size:0.875em;\"></td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:center; font-size:0.9375em;\"></td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:left; font-size:0.875em;\"></td>\n</tr></tbody></table>\n<hr />\n<table cellspacing=\"0px\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-bottom:4px; width:100%; border-style:none; background-color:;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:3%; font-weight:bold; font-size:0.875em;\" id=\"2\">2</td>\n<td style=\"width:12%; text-align:right; font-weight:normal; font-size:0.9375em;\">19 november 2017</td>\n<td style=\"width:24%; text-align:right; font-weight:bold; font-size:1em;;\"><a href=\"/wiki/J%C3%B6nk%C3%B6pings_S%C3%B6dra_IF\" title=\"Jönköpings Södra IF\">Jönköpings Södra</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:12%; text-align:center; font-weight:bold; font-size:1em;\">\n<a href=\"/wiki/Kvalspelet_till_Fotbollsallsvenskan_2018#Andra_mötet\" title=\"Kvalspelet till Fotbollsallsvenskan 2018\">1 – 1</a></td>\n\n<td style=\"width:24%; text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:1em;;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Trelleborgs_FF\" title=\"Trelleborgs FF\">Trelleborgs FF</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:24%; text-align:left; font-size:0.875em;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stadsparksvallen\" title=\"Stadsparksvallen\">Stadsparksvallen</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/J%C3%B6nk%C3%B6ping\" title=\"Jönköping\">Jönköping</a></td>\n<th style=\"width:1%; font-size:0.9375em;\"></th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:right; font-size:0.9375em;\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\"></td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:right; font-size:0.875em;\"></td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:center; font-size:0.875em;\"></td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:left; font-size:0.875em;\"></td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:left; font-size:0.875em;\" rowspan=\"3\" colspan=\"2\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:center; font-size:0.90em;\" colspan=\"3\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:right; font-size:0.875em;\"></td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:center; font-size:0.9375em;\"></td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:left; font-size:0.875em;\"></td>\n</tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading4\"><h4 id=\"Nedflyttningskval\">Nedflyttningskval</h4><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Superettan_2017&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Redigera avsnitt: Nedflyttningskval\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>redigera</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Superettan_2017&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Redigera avsnitts källkod: Nedflyttningskval\"><span>redigera wikitext</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>Laget som slutade på 14:e plats, <a href=\"/wiki/IK_Frej\" title=\"IK Frej\">IK Frej</a>, i superettan spelade ett kvalspel mot det lag som slutade på 2:a plats i <a href=\"/wiki/Division_1_i_fotboll_f%C3%B6r_herrar_2017\" title=\"Division 1 i fotboll för herrar 2017\">division 1 norra</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Akropolis_IF\" title=\"Akropolis IF\">Akropolis IF</a>. Laget som slutade på 13:e plats i superettan, <a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96rgryte_IS\" title=\"Örgryte IS\">Örgryte IS</a>, spelade ett kvalspel mot det lag som slutade på 2:a plats i <a href=\"/wiki/Division_1_i_fotboll_f%C3%B6r_herrar_2017\" title=\"Division 1 i fotboll för herrar 2017\">division 1 södra</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Mj%C3%A4llby_AIF\" title=\"Mjällby AIF\">Mjällby AIF</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-23\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-23\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>23<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0px\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-bottom:4px; width:100%; border-style:none; background-color:transparent;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:3%; font-weight:bold; font-size:0.875em;\" id=\"1\">1</td>\n<td style=\"width:12%; text-align:right; font-weight:normal; font-size:0.9375em;\">8 november 2017</td>\n<td style=\"width:24%; text-align:right; font-weight:bold; font-size:1em;;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Akropolis_IF\" title=\"Akropolis IF\">Akropolis IF</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:12%; text-align:center; font-weight:bold; font-size:1em;\">\n1 – 1</td>\n\n<td style=\"width:24%; text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:1em;;\"><a href=\"/wiki/IK_Frej\" title=\"IK Frej\">IK Frej</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:24%; text-align:left; font-size:0.875em;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sp%C3%A5nga_IP\" title=\"Spånga IP\">Spånga IP</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Stockholm\" title=\"Stockholm\">Stockholm</a></td>\n<th style=\"width:1%; font-size:0.9375em;\"></th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:right; font-size:0.9375em;\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">19:00&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Koordinerad_universell_tid\" title=\"Koordinerad universell tid\">UTC+1</a><br /></td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:right; font-size:0.875em;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Marcus_Haglind_Sangr%C3%A9\" title=\"Marcus Ha